BEGIN TAXA;
  DIMENSIONS NTAX=29;
  TAXLABELS Trilobita Ammonoidea Actinopterygii Synapsida Lepidosauria Ichthyosauria Plesiosauria Pterosauria Crocodylomorpha Abelisauridae Noasauridae Megalosauridae Spinosauridae Allosauridae Carcharodontosauridae Tyrannosauridae Ornithomimosauria Therizinosauridae Dromaeosauridae Troodontidae Diplodocidae Brachiosauridae Titanosauria Stegosauria Ankylosauria Hadrosauridae Pachycephalosauria Ceratopsidae Plantae;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
  TREE open_paleo = (((Trilobita)Arthropoda,((Ammonoidea)Cephalopoda)Mollusca,((Actinopterygii,((Synapsida,(Lepidosauria,Ichthyosauria,(Plesiosauria)Sauropterygia,(Pterosauria,Crocodylomorpha,((((Abelisauridae,Noasauridae)Ceratosauria,((Megalosauridae,Spinosauridae)Megalosauroidea,((Allosauridae,Carcharodontosauridae)Carnosauria,(Tyrannosauridae,Ornithomimosauria,(Therizinosauridae,Dromaeosauridae,Troodontidae)Maniraptora)Coelurosauria)Avetheropoda)Tetanurae)Theropoda,((Diplodocidae,(Brachiosauridae,Titanosauria)Macronaria)Sauropoda)Sauropodomorpha)Saurischia,((Stegosauria,Ankylosauria)Thyreophora,(((((Hadrosauridae)Hadrosauriformes)Styracosterna)Ankylopollexia)Ornithopoda,(Pachycephalosauria,(Ceratopsidae)Ceratopsia)Marginocephalia)Cerapoda)Ornithischia)Dinosauria)Archosauria)Reptilia)Tetrapoda)Sarcopterygii)Vertebrata)Chordata)Animalia,Plantae)Life;
